WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,150
I'm just half a month late

2
00:00:02,150 --> 00:00:04,670
It’s not necessarily true whether there is one or not.

3
00:00:04,670 --> 00:00:05,990
Just go to the hospital and find out

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:08,030
Such a precious thing

5
00:00:08,030 --> 00:00:09,110
You feed me again

6
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,670
No matter how valuable something is

7
00:00:10,870 --> 00:00:22,620
Neither is your golden magnolia

8
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:28,840
Isn't this the rotten drug addict from your family?

9
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,310
Now even the public car

10
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:31,710
You dare to drive it out to show off?

11
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,200
My man joined the public sales agency

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,600
Twenty yuan a month

13
00:00:35,880 --> 00:00:37,360
People need to be appointed

14
00:00:37,360 --> 00:00:39,160
Your legs just keep running.

15
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,440
Why are you pretending to be a big shot?

16
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,800
Wife, slow down
